#: ../../../hwmon/adt7411.rst:19
msgid ""
"This driver implements support for the Analog Devices ADT7411 chip. There "
"may be other chips that implement this interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/adt7411.rst:22
msgid ""
"The ADT7411 can use an I2C/SMBus compatible 2-wire interface or an SPI-"
"compatible 4-wire interface. It provides a 10-bit analog to digital "
"converter which measures 1 temperature, vdd and 8 input voltages. It has an "
"internal temperature sensor, but an external one can also be connected (one "
"loses 2 inputs then). There are high- and low-limit registers for all inputs."
msgstr ""

